"meth.title":"Methodology","meth.m1":"Log returns; volatility by EWMA (last 30 returns) or GARCH(1,1) when 250+ days are available.","meth.m2":"Simulation: S₁ = S₀·exp((μ − σ²/2) + σ·z), z from a unit-variance Student-t with nu degrees of freedom.","meth.m3":"Local price per gram = (global price ÷ 31.1035) × FX rate × (karat ÷ 24) + making charge. The riyal peg 3.75 is assumed if no rate is available.","meth.m4":"Fairness ratio = market price ÷ fair value: above 1.15 overvalued, 0.85–1.15 fair, below 0.85 undervalued.","meth.m5":"Statistical Lab: normality, stationarity, autocorrelation and ARCH tests, GARCH and GJR models, FHS fan chart, OLS and Engle–Granger regression, rolling correlations.","meth.m6":"Historical sources: Yahoo Finance, Stooq and FRED through CORS proxies; they may lag or fail, and your local data stays untouched.","meth.m7":"Spot gold quotes differ by a few dollars across sources; the history uses the XAU/USD spot close.","meth.m8":"All outputs are probabilistic ranges, not investment advice, and guarantee nothing.",
